{%- comment -%}
  snippets/structured-data.liquid
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  Sitewide JSON-LD structured data for the Loulou Lollipop theme.
  Renders the correct schema graph based on request.page_type.
  Rendered once from sections/header.liquid (header-group renders on
  every page), so this file fires site-wide with no per-template calls:

    {%- render 'structured-data', logo: section.settings.logo -%}

  If ever moved to render directly from layout/theme.liquid instead,
  drop the `logo` param — it will fall back to shop.brand.logo (Admin >
  Settings > Brand) and omit the "logo" key entirely if neither is set,
  since `section` isn't available outside a section context.

  Sections included:
    1. Homepage   -> Organization, WebSite, SearchAction, WebPage, (optional LocalBusiness)
    2. PDP        -> BreadcrumbList, WebPage/ItemPage, Product, AggregateOffer, (optional FAQ)
    3. PLP        -> BreadcrumbList, WebPage/CollectionPage, ItemList, (optional FAQ)
    4. Page       -> Organization, WebPage
                     (BreadcrumbList stays in snippets/breadcrumbs.liquid)

  Notes:
  - Uses the Liquid `json` filter for all free-text fields (handles quotes/
    apostrophes/special chars safely) instead of manual escaping.
  - GTIN is mapped by barcode length rather than assuming gtin13.
  - aggregateRating / review only output when metafields are present.
    Rating source is the standard Shopify "reviews" metafield namespace
    (product.metafields.reviews.rating / .rating_count), same source
    already used for the on-page star rating in snippets/rating.liquid.
  - FAQ schema only outputs when the corresponding metafield is populated
    (product.metafields.custom.product_faqs / collection.metafields.custom.collection_faqs).
    Neither metafield exists on this store yet, so these blocks are
    currently inert by design — only enable/populate them once matching
    FAQ content is visibly rendered on the page (see FAQ protocol note
    in the JSON-LD fix-up plan re: templates/page.faq.json using
    collapsible-tabs blocks, not metafields, for its current FAQ content).
  - BreadcrumbList for product/collection is emitted here; snippets/breadcrumbs.liquid
    suppresses its own BreadcrumbList JSON-LD on those two templates
    (via show_structured_data) to avoid duplicating this block, but still
    renders the visible breadcrumb nav and still emits BreadcrumbList
    JSON-LD on blog/article/page templates, which this file doesn't cover.
    Section 4 deliberately does not add a page BreadcrumbList for that
    reason -- see the note there.
  - The Organization node lives in snippets/structured-data-organization.liquid
    so sections 1 and 4 share one definition rather than two that drift.
  - This file replaces the former snippets/structured-data-header.liquid
    and snippets/structured-data-product.liquid (deleted) to avoid the
    duplicate/conflicting Organization + Product schema problem those
    two files had.
  - Before enabling on a client store, audit for duplicate schema from
    review apps (Judge.me, Yotpo, etc.) or AEO/SEO apps that may already
    output Product / FAQPage / Organization schema.
{%- endcomment -%}


{%- comment -%}
  ================= 1. HOMEPAGE =================
  LocalBusiness block below is OPTIONAL and only renders when
  shop.metafields.custom.local_business_type is populated (e.g. "Store",
  "ClothingStore", "JewelryStore" -- any valid schema.org LocalBusiness
  subtype). This keeps the block safely off for online-only stores with
  no physical storefront/showroom. Not currently set for this store.

  Required metafields (Settings > Custom data > Shop, namespace: custom):
    local_business_type       (single line text)  e.g. "ClothingStore"
    local_business_street     (single line text)
    local_business_city       (single line text)
    local_business_region     (single line text)  e.g. state/province
    local_business_postal     (single line text)
    local_business_country    (single line text)  ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, e.g. "CA"
    local_business_lat        (number, decimal)    optional but recommended
    local_business_lng        (number, decimal)    optional but recommended
    local_business_hours      (single line text)   optional, schema.org format
                                 e.g. "Mo-Sa 10:00-19:00"
    local_business_pricerange (single line text)   optional, e.g. "$$"
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'index' -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {%- render 'structured-data-organization', logo: logo -%},
    {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#website",
      "url": "{{ shop.url }}",
      "name": {{ shop.name | json }},
      "publisher": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#organization" },
      "inLanguage": "{{ request.locale.iso_code | default: 'en' }}",
      "potentialAction": {
        "@type": "SearchAction",
        "target": "{{ shop.url }}{{ routes.search_url }}?q={search_term_string}",
        "query-input": "required name=search_term_string"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#webpage",
      "url": "{{ shop.url }}",
      "name": {{ shop.name | json }},
      "description": {{ page_description | default: shop.description | default: shop.name | strip_html | strip_newlines | truncate: 300 | json }},
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#website" },
      "about": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#organization" },
      "inLanguage": "{{ request.locale.iso_code | default: 'en' }}"
    }
    {%- if shop.metafields.custom.local_business_type != blank -%},
    {
      "@type": {{ shop.metafields.custom.local_business_type | json }},
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#localbusiness",
      "name": {{ shop.name | json }},
      "url": "{{ shop.url }}",
      "parentOrganization": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#organization" }
      {%- if shop.phone != blank -%},
      "telephone": {{ shop.phone | json }}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if shop.email != blank -%},
      "email": {{ shop.email | json }}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if shop.metafields.custom.local_business_pricerange != blank -%},
      "priceRange": {{ shop.metafields.custom.local_business_pricerange.value | json }}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if shop.metafields.custom.local_business_street != blank -%},
      "address": {
        "@type": "PostalAddress",
        "streetAddress": {{ shop.metafields.custom.local_business_street.value | json }},
        "addressLocality": {{ shop.metafields.custom.local_business_city.value | json }},
        "addressRegion": {{ shop.metafields.custom.local_business_region.value | json }},
        "postalCode": {{ shop.metafields.custom.local_business_postal.value | json }},
        "addressCountry": {{ shop.metafields.custom.local_business_country.value | json }}
      }
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if shop.metafields.custom.local_business_lat != blank and shop.metafields.custom.local_business_lng != blank -%},
      "geo": {
        "@type": "GeoCoordinates",
        "latitude": {{ shop.metafields.custom.local_business_lat.value }},
        "longitude": {{ shop.metafields.custom.local_business_lng.value }}
      }
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if shop.metafields.custom.local_business_hours != blank -%},
      "openingHours": {{ shop.metafields.custom.local_business_hours.value | json }}
      {%- endif -%}
    }
    {%- endif -%}
  ]
}
</script>
{%- endif -%}


{%- comment -%}
  ================= 2. PRODUCT (PDP) =================
  The Product entity itself (offers, aggregateRating, material, gtin, ...)
  lives in snippets/structured-data-product.liquid so it can also be
  reused by sections/featured-product.liquid, which embeds a single
  product on non-product templates (e.g. templates/collection.flash-sale.json,
  collection.alternative.json) with its own section-scoped `product` —
  that section can't rely on request.page_type == 'product' gating below,
  since it renders on collection pages.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'product' and product -%}
  {%- assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}#breadcrumbs",
      "itemListElement": [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 1,
          "name": "Home",
          "item": "{{ shop.url }}"
        }
        {%- if collection -%},
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 2,
          "name": {{ collection.title | json }},
          "item": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}"
        }
        {%- endif -%},
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": {% if collection %}3{% else %}2{% endif %},
          "name": {{ product.title | json }},
          "item": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": ["WebPage", "ItemPage"],
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}#webpage",
      "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}",
      "name": {{ product.title | json }},
      "description": {{ product.description | strip_html | strip_newlines | truncate: 500 | json }},
      "inLanguage": "{{ request.locale.iso_code | default: 'en' }}",
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#website" },
      "breadcrumb": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}#breadcrumbs" },
      "mainEntity": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}#product" }
    }
  ]
}
</script>
  {%- render 'structured-data-product', product: product, current_variant: current_variant -%}
{%- endif -%}


{%- comment -%} ================= 2b. PDP FAQ (separate script, optional) ================= {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign faq_data = product.metafields.custom.product_faqs.value -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'product' and faq_data.faqs != blank -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}#faq",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for faq in faq_data.faqs -%}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": {{ faq.question | strip_html | strip_newlines | json }},
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": {{ faq.answer | strip_html | strip_newlines | json }}
      }
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
</script>
{%- endif -%}


{%- comment -%} ================= 3. COLLECTION (PLP) ================= {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'collection' and collection -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}#breadcrumbs",
      "itemListElement": [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 1,
          "name": "Home",
          "item": "{{ shop.url }}"
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 2,
          "name": {{ collection.title | json }},
          "item": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": ["WebPage", "CollectionPage"],
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}#webpage",
      "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}",
      "name": {{ collection.title | json }},
      "description": {{ collection.description | strip_html | strip_newlines | truncate: 500 | json }},
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#website" },
      "inLanguage": "{{ request.locale.iso_code | default: 'en' }}",
      "breadcrumb": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}#breadcrumbs" },
      "about": {
        "@type": "Thing",
        "name": {{ collection.title | json }}
      },
      "mainEntity": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}#itemlist" }
    },
    {
      "@type": "ItemList",
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}#itemlist",
      "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}",
      "numberOfItems": {{ collection.products_count }},
      "itemListElement": [
        {%- for product in collection.products -%}
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": {{ forloop.index }},
          "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}",
          "name": {{ product.title | json }},
          "item": {
            "@type": "Product",
            "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}#product",
            "name": {{ product.title | json }},
            "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}"
            {%- if product.featured_image -%},
            "image": "{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1024 | prepend: 'https:' }}"
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.sku != blank -%},
            "sku": {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.sku | json }}
            {%- endif -%},
            "brand": {
              "@type": "Brand",
              "name": {% if product.vendor != blank %}{{ product.vendor | json }}{% else %}{{ shop.name | json }}{% endif %}
            }
          }
        }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
        {%- endfor -%}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>
{%- endif -%}


{%- comment -%} ================= 3b. PLP FAQ (separate script, optional) ================= {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'collection' and collection.metafields.custom.collection_faqs.value != blank -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}#faq",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for faq in collection.metafields.custom.collection_faqs.value -%}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": {{ faq.question | strip_html | strip_newlines | json }},
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": {{ faq.answer | strip_html | strip_newlines | json }}
      }
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
</script>
{%- endif -%}


{%- comment -%}
  ================= 4. PAGE =================
  Pages had no branch here at all, so /pages/sleep-bags emitted zero
  JSON-LD -- verified on the live page, 0 ld+json scripts.

  Deliberately NO BreadcrumbList here. snippets/breadcrumbs.liquid already
  emits one for 'page' and is rendered by sections/main-page.liquid; a
  custom landing template that wants it simply includes a main-page
  section (which also gives the shopper a visible breadcrumb, so the
  markup describes something actually on the page). Duplicating it here
  would mean suppressing it there, and that is a much larger change to a
  snippet every template depends on.

  Organization is included so informational pages carry brand identity as
  a real entity rather than relying on a cross-page @id reference, which
  Google does not resolve between documents. The WebPage node's
  "breadcrumb" key points at the @id breadcrumbs.liquid emits when it is
  present, and is simply unresolved when it isn't -- harmless either way.

  Deliberately no ItemList: this snippet renders from the header and has
  no way to know which products a given page template puts on the page.
  Emitting a guessed list risks describing products that aren't there.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'page' and page -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {%- render 'structured-data-organization', logo: logo -%},
    {
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}{{ page.url }}#webpage",
      "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ page.url }}",
      "name": {{ page.title | json }},
      "description": {{ page.metafields.global.description_tag | default: page.content | strip_html | strip_newlines | truncate: 300 | json }},
      "isPartOf": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#website" },
      "about": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#organization" },
      "publisher": { "@id": "{{ shop.url }}#organization" },
      "inLanguage": "{{ request.locale.iso_code | default: 'en' }}"
    }
  ]
}
</script>
{%- endif -%}
